  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.38 with immutable ProGPU preview.44; consumes compact Skia paint, text, path, gradient, and rounded-rectangle hot paths, direct writable-bitmap snapshots, and same-device immutable-image texture leasing without adding a bridge workaround; retains the typed, zero-allocation media drawing-state seam, native activation, popup-local input diagnostics, bounded render-resource ownership, and static-frame render suppression; and preserves the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
